    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Bluff 10 ranks, Bluster sphere (Fabricate Memory).</p>\n<p>When you successfully use Fabricate Memory, the target also recounts a brief summary of their original memory for you before altering it. If you also have the Investigation sphere and at least 10 ranks in Sense Motive, you deduce the major elements of the original memory without them saying anything.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/bluster#toc48\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
